WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.145 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:46.065 --> 01:48.105
His Majesty has arrived!

5
01:49.185 --> 01:51.625
Quick! Take everything away! Hurry!

6
02:03.545 --> 02:05.065
-Your Majesty. -No, no.

7
02:05.145 --> 02:07.585
There's no need for formalities. Here.

8
02:10.744 --> 02:12.065
Are you feeling any better?

9
02:13.025 --> 02:14.905
Thank you for your concern, Your Majesty.

10
02:16.145 --> 02:17.905
My illness comes from a broken heart.

11
02:18.585 --> 02:20.265
I'm afraid I'll never recover.

12
02:21.265 --> 02:23.745
I've served Your Majesty for over twenty years,

13
02:24.265 --> 02:25.945
always with respect and devotion.

14
02:26.545 --> 02:29.585
And now, a young girl dares to talk back to me.

15
02:30.385 --> 02:32.545
Worse, Lady Li slapped me.

16
02:33.465 --> 02:35.265
In front of everyone,

17
02:35.345 --> 02:37.945
I was utterly humiliated.

18
02:39.025 --> 02:41.745
What's the point of living anymore?

19
02:42.425 --> 02:44.665
Didn't I send her to apologize to you?

20
02:44.745 --> 02:46.385
You're the one who turned her away.

21
02:47.185 --> 02:49.465
Who wants her fake sympathy?

22
02:50.065 --> 02:50.905
Behind my back,

23
02:50.985 --> 02:52.945
she arranged Liu Shuo's marriage to the Xie family.

24
02:53.025 --> 02:56.145
Then she rushed to bring Hongxian into her household!

25
02:56.225 --> 02:59.905
Why does she get every good thing in the world?

26
02:59.985 --> 03:02.265
Your Majesty, how can she be so overbearing?

27
03:02.345 --> 03:03.785
Your Majesty!

28
03:04.625 --> 03:06.665
Ask that precious son of yours!

29
03:07.625 --> 03:09.185
Now that he's Crown Prince,

30
03:09.265 --> 03:10.505
he's grown ever more lecherous.

31
03:11.145 --> 03:14.225
The beauties in his residence outnumber the palace's attendants.

32
03:15.665 --> 03:18.185
He even abducted women, causing public outrage!

33
03:18.705 --> 03:20.065
I had already pardoned him.

34
03:20.145 --> 03:22.785
Yet he persuaded you to stir up more trouble!

35
03:24.505 --> 03:26.345
I was the one who arranged Liu Shuo's marriage.

36
03:27.505 --> 03:29.185
And you dare question my judgment?

37
03:29.825 --> 03:32.265
It seems I shouldn't have come here today.

38
03:34.905 --> 03:37.105
Your Majesty! Your Majesty, please!

39
03:37.185 --> 03:38.825
I know I was wrong!

40
03:38.905 --> 03:40.545
I… I was foolish!

41
03:41.145 --> 03:43.865
From now on, I'll make sure to advise the Crown Prince

42
03:43.945 --> 03:45.585
to watch his words and actions.

43
03:46.465 --> 03:48.105
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

44
03:50.465 --> 03:51.305
Get up.

45
03:52.905 --> 03:54.065
You're still ill.

46
03:54.985 --> 03:57.865
Don't let that ungrateful son upset you and make you worse.

47
03:58.705 --> 03:59.985
Your Majesty,

48
04:00.065 --> 04:01.905
the Crown Prince is kind and devoted.

49
04:02.425 --> 04:05.505
He'd even risk his life to save you in a moment of danger.

50
04:06.145 --> 04:08.905
No one can match his loyalty to you as both ruler and father.

51
04:09.425 --> 04:11.225
He's simply too young

52
04:11.305 --> 04:13.625
and easily misled by petty schemers.

53
04:14.145 --> 04:17.504
If Your Majesty appoints more honest advisers to guide him,

54
04:17.585 --> 04:19.345
I'm sure he'll change his ways.

55
04:20.504 --> 04:21.504
I know.

56
04:22.305 --> 04:25.105
I still have state affairs to attend to. I'll return to Xuanshi Palace.

57
04:28.505 --> 04:30.185
Your Majesty, please stay for dinner.

58
04:30.265 --> 04:33.905
I've asked the kitchen to prepare ginseng chicken soup

59
04:33.985 --> 04:35.345
especially for you.

60
04:38.945 --> 04:41.905
Your Majesty rarely visits Furong Hall.

61
04:42.825 --> 04:43.825
And now,

62
04:44.865 --> 04:46.825
you can't even bear

63
04:47.785 --> 04:49.265
to share a meal with me?

64
04:49.865 --> 04:50.905
I…

65
04:50.985 --> 04:53.865
Once I've finished my work, I'll come back and dine with you.

66
04:54.705 --> 04:57.625
I won't blame you for the Crown Prince's mistakes.

67
04:59.905 --> 05:01.505
Thank you, Your Majesty.

68
05:07.425 --> 05:08.465
You there.

69
05:12.105 --> 05:15.985
Bring me the herbs the Crown Princess sent.

70
05:16.625 --> 05:17.465
Yes, My Lady.

71
05:33.225 --> 05:34.505
Go greet your elder sister.

72
05:35.905 --> 05:37.025
Of course.

73
05:43.185 --> 05:44.745
Why so quiet, sister-in-law?

74
05:45.465 --> 05:47.145
What should you call me?

75
05:47.905 --> 05:50.945
I was disrespectful to you before.

76
05:51.545 --> 05:55.025
Please forgive me, Rao.

77
05:57.585 --> 05:59.745
The one you resented was never me.

78
05:59.825 --> 06:00.825
No old grudge at all,

79
06:01.545 --> 06:03.985
it's only right that we make peace.

80
06:04.825 --> 06:07.145
Rao, don't tease her. She's a proper young lady.

81
06:07.225 --> 06:08.545
She is, but you're not.

82
06:09.465 --> 06:12.545
Otherwise, you wouldn't have been sneaking around behind our backs.

83
06:16.585 --> 06:17.745
Everyone, take a seat.

84
06:18.265 --> 06:19.385
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

85
06:19.465 --> 06:21.425
The infected from Anzhou have entered the capital.

86
06:22.185 --> 06:23.865
I'm sure the palace has heard by now.

87
06:25.705 --> 06:28.305
I've been busy with matters at my estate lately.

88
06:28.385 --> 06:29.785
I won't be able to visit the palace often.

89
06:29.865 --> 06:32.305
If Your Ladyship needs anything, have Yinggu bring me a message.

90
06:33.705 --> 06:36.785
Mother won't change Rao's mind. There's no point wasting your breath.

91
06:39.665 --> 06:41.265
Stubborn to the bone, as always.

92
06:41.345 --> 06:43.905
Rao, please be careful.

93
06:44.425 --> 06:45.265
I will.

94
06:48.825 --> 06:50.825
Your Ladyship, His Majesty has sent word.

95
06:50.905 --> 06:53.225
He won't be joining you for dinner today. Please dine without him.

96
06:54.505 --> 06:55.705
Whose palace has he gone to?

97
06:56.425 --> 06:57.785
Furong Hall.

98
06:58.345 --> 06:59.545
Lady Zheng?

99
07:00.985 --> 07:03.345
Well, that's a first.

100
07:09.265 --> 07:13.425
ZHAOYANG PALACE

101
07:14.225 --> 07:17.425
Something isn't right at Furong Hall. For His Majesty's safety,

102
07:17.945 --> 07:19.625
Prince Fu and the others should be informed.

103
07:20.345 --> 07:22.985
Don't worry, Rao. I'll handle it.

104
07:25.305 --> 07:26.185
Rao.

105
07:27.985 --> 07:28.825
Please be careful.

106
07:30.945 --> 07:31.785
I will.

107
07:38.745 --> 07:39.785
You know,

108
07:41.065 --> 07:42.905
Rao spent years living among commoners.

109
07:43.785 --> 07:45.105
Before she even knew I existed,

110
07:45.825 --> 07:48.905
Mother would constantly remind me…

111
07:52.905 --> 07:55.025
Remember what I'm telling you.

112
07:55.105 --> 07:56.345
In the palace,

113
07:56.425 --> 07:58.025
no matter how many siblings you have,

114
07:58.625 --> 08:00.265
they've all got their own schemes.

115
08:00.345 --> 08:02.225
None of them are really on your side.

116
08:03.265 --> 08:05.505
You have only one true sister,

117
08:06.105 --> 08:07.825
born of the same mother.

118
08:08.345 --> 08:10.105
Then where is my real sister?

119
08:11.145 --> 08:12.425
With the Wei family.

120
08:15.465 --> 08:17.185
Shuo, remember this.

121
08:19.025 --> 08:20.945
When you're older, respect her.

122
08:21.785 --> 08:23.145
Treat her well.

123
08:25.025 --> 08:28.145
And on my behalf, make up for what she's suffered.

124
08:28.945 --> 08:30.625
Give her all the love you can.

125
08:30.705 --> 08:32.264
YOUNG LIU SHUO

126
08:41.784 --> 08:43.705
Mother wouldn't let me see her before.

127
08:44.345 --> 08:45.985
She feared I'd bring trouble upon her.

128
08:46.825 --> 08:48.705
Now we've finally been reunited.

129
08:49.265 --> 08:51.825
But no matter how sincerely I open my heart to her,

130
08:52.345 --> 08:54.225
I still can't move her even a little.

131
08:55.505 --> 08:57.625
Sometimes I really envy Lord Lu.

132
08:58.785 --> 09:01.225
Somehow, he managed to melt her icy heart.

133
09:06.185 --> 09:08.785
Someday, she'll understand how you feel.

134
09:09.745 --> 09:11.705
I wish I knew how he did it.

135
09:12.225 --> 09:14.225
I'm so jealous.

136
09:14.825 --> 09:16.345
It just doesn't seem fair.

137
09:17.025 --> 09:20.945
My sister and I should be closer than anyone else in the world.

138
09:21.465 --> 09:22.305
Shouldn't we?

139
09:33.985 --> 09:34.945
Here.

140
09:35.625 --> 09:37.425
-Take it straight over there. -All right.

141
09:42.105 --> 09:43.105
Hurry! Hurry!

142
09:43.185 --> 09:44.265
Do you have enough ginger?

143
09:44.865 --> 09:45.985
Coming.

144
09:46.065 --> 09:47.185
-Careful, it's hot. -This one is ready.

145
09:47.265 --> 09:48.585
Here. I'll take it.

146
09:50.465 --> 09:51.305
Mother?

147
09:56.105 --> 09:58.185
-We need someone over here, too. -Coming!

148
09:58.265 --> 09:59.105
You can't be here.

149
09:59.705 --> 10:01.545
If you are here, why can't I?

150
10:02.145 --> 10:04.665
If I stay away, no one else will come.

151
10:04.745 --> 10:06.825
But if I am here, no one will dare to stay away.

152
10:06.905 --> 10:08.465
You're just like my Zhuo.

153
10:08.545 --> 10:10.465
He always leads his men into battle.

154
10:10.545 --> 10:12.145
You two really are a perfect match.

155
10:12.225 --> 10:14.905
Besides, I'm hardly of noble birth.

156
10:14.985 --> 10:18.465
My own father was an army physician. A little plague doesn't scare me.

157
10:18.545 --> 10:20.545
Mother, treating plague patients is no joke.

158
10:20.625 --> 10:21.705
Neither am I.

159
10:21.785 --> 10:23.825
If we hadn't stopped her,

160
10:23.905 --> 10:26.385
the Dowager Lady would've come along, too.

161
10:26.465 --> 10:28.465
We'll do exactly as I said.

162
10:31.825 --> 10:33.705
Changning, Changhui, come help!

163
10:34.505 --> 10:36.265
-Coming! -No! I don't want to go over there!

164
10:38.665 --> 10:41.065
The plague is spreading. No one is safe.

165
10:41.665 --> 10:43.665
Hearing of Her Ladyship's charity in medicine,

166
10:43.745 --> 10:46.105
the noblewomen all followed suit.

167
10:46.185 --> 10:47.945
Even your mother is out there,

168
10:48.025 --> 10:49.425
doing everything to gather herbs.

169
10:50.025 --> 10:51.985
Old Madam said no one in our family runs from danger.

170
10:52.585 --> 10:54.585
The ladies won't fall behind.

171
10:54.665 --> 10:57.345
If you leave now, you'll never set foot in the house again,

172
10:57.425 --> 10:58.665
and call yourself one of us.

173
10:58.745 --> 10:59.785
I…

174
11:01.625 --> 11:02.985
-All right, all right. -Now hurry up.

175
11:09.745 --> 11:12.105
Mint leaves, burdock seeds, and scallions.

176
11:12.705 --> 11:14.065
What remedy are you using?

177
11:14.145 --> 11:16.425
The patients have chills and dampness in their systems.

178
11:17.025 --> 11:18.425
Many suffer from headaches and pressure in the forehead,

179
11:18.505 --> 11:20.785
fever, chills, coughing, and shortness of breath.

180
11:20.865 --> 11:22.225
I gathered every physician in the city for a consultation.

181
11:22.305 --> 11:24.625
We've agreed to treat them with Wind-Dispelling Decoction.

182
11:25.465 --> 11:27.985
My father once told me… This works well in the early stages.

183
11:28.585 --> 11:30.465
But once fever and yellow phlegm appear,

184
11:30.545 --> 11:32.865
switch to Ganlu Disinfection Pills.

185
11:33.505 --> 11:35.665
Their medicine is too cooling. Change it.

186
11:38.185 --> 11:39.025
See?

187
11:40.225 --> 11:43.705
The nausea is easy to treat, too. Just add half a spoonful of ginger juice.

188
11:44.305 --> 11:45.065
That should do the trick.

189
11:46.105 --> 11:46.985
Do it.

190
11:48.625 --> 11:49.705
Now do you believe me?

191
11:50.985 --> 11:52.385
Thank you for your help, Mother.

192
11:52.465 --> 11:54.425
Come on! Let's add more firewood

193
11:54.505 --> 11:56.865
-and brew the medicine again! -I'll take this over.

194
11:56.945 --> 11:58.065
Coming!

195
12:00.465 --> 12:01.385
Thank you!

196
12:05.505 --> 12:06.585
Isn't she afraid?

197
12:07.345 --> 12:09.905
She fears neither death nor filth.

198
12:09.985 --> 12:12.345
No wonder the people worship her.

199
12:12.425 --> 12:14.105
Even I have nothing but respect for her.

200
12:14.905 --> 12:16.705
The young ladies keep asking me about her.

201
12:17.505 --> 12:19.305
They all want to meet Noble Lady Wu'an.

202
12:19.825 --> 12:22.705
You don't know how lucky you are.

203
12:23.265 --> 12:25.625
Keep finding fault, and you'll regret it.

204
12:37.105 --> 12:38.145
Here.

205
12:42.425 --> 12:43.585
Here.

206
12:48.025 --> 12:51.705
ZHAO

207
12:57.265 --> 12:58.425
Another one collapsed?

208
13:05.105 --> 13:07.025
All right! Resume your drills!

209
13:09.865 --> 13:10.905
That's the seventh in three days.

210
13:11.505 --> 13:13.145
Lu Zhuo, we can't go on like this.

211
13:13.865 --> 13:15.705
They're not just trying to disrupt the capital.

212
13:16.345 --> 13:17.745
They want chaos in the army, too.

213
13:18.385 --> 13:19.505
What are they after?

214
13:20.425 --> 13:23.065
Now isn't the time for that. Inspect the barracks first.

215
13:23.145 --> 13:25.625
Move the sick to a ward for treatment.

216
13:31.625 --> 13:33.185
XUANSHI PALACE

217
13:33.265 --> 13:35.545
Your Majesty, a plague has broken out in the army.

218
13:35.625 --> 13:37.545
Twelve soldiers have fallen ill.

219
13:37.625 --> 13:39.625
I ordered the physicians to inspect the barracks.

220
13:39.705 --> 13:41.705
We isolated the sick overnight in separate wards.

221
13:41.785 --> 13:44.585
Fortunately, we caught it early. The disease hasn't spread.

222
13:46.585 --> 13:48.185
Nothing must happen to the army.

223
13:49.065 --> 13:50.545
I obey, Your Majesty.

224
13:52.105 --> 13:54.945
Father, as Emperor, the realm rests on your shoulders.

225
13:55.025 --> 13:56.865
For the sake of your people,

226
13:56.945 --> 14:00.105
I humbly beg you to withdraw to the Hot Springs Palace

227
14:00.185 --> 14:01.585
until this crisis has passed.

228
14:02.545 --> 14:03.745
Absolutely not!

229
14:03.825 --> 14:05.505
Father, I risk my life to plead with you.

230
14:05.585 --> 14:07.265
The Emperor is the father of his people.

231
14:08.065 --> 14:09.385
They now trapped in their homes.

232
14:09.985 --> 14:12.785
Father, you are the one taking command.

233
14:13.585 --> 14:14.665
If the Crown Prince fears the plague so much,

234
14:14.745 --> 14:16.585
he's welcome to flee on his own!

235
14:17.185 --> 14:20.065
I wish to stay and defend the capital with you, Father!

236
14:20.145 --> 14:21.665
What a devoted son you are.

237
14:21.745 --> 14:24.585
You only care about your own reputation, yet nothing about Father!

238
14:25.225 --> 14:28.185
Father, I believe we must reassure the people.

239
14:28.785 --> 14:31.385
Your health comes first. Best to withdraw to the traveling palace.

240
14:32.345 --> 14:34.505
Will it be the Crown Prince or Prince Fu?

241
14:34.585 --> 14:35.705
Your Majesty!

242
14:37.745 --> 14:40.345
Your Majesty, Grand Minister Zhao caught the plague.

243
14:40.425 --> 14:41.345
He's passed away.

244
14:42.985 --> 14:44.305
You heard that?

245
14:44.825 --> 14:46.145
Emperors always took shelter from plagues.

246
14:46.225 --> 14:48.465
Personal safety is a minor concern. The foundation of the realm is at stake!

247
14:49.145 --> 14:50.905
You're just showing off to win praise.

248
14:50.985 --> 14:52.385
You're neither a dutiful son nor a loyal subject!

249
14:52.465 --> 14:54.505
-Grand Minister Zhao was nearly eighty! -Your Majesty.

250
14:54.585 --> 14:57.345
Father is still in his prime! How can you compare the two?

251
14:58.625 --> 14:59.665
My elixir.

252
15:00.865 --> 15:02.425
Bring me my elixir.

253
15:22.065 --> 15:23.625
-Your Majesty! -Father!

254
15:23.705 --> 15:24.705
-Your Majesty! -Father!

255
15:24.785 --> 15:25.705
-Summon a physician! -Father!

256
15:25.785 --> 15:27.145
-Father! -Father!

257
15:30.865 --> 15:31.905
Your Majesty!

258
15:35.425 --> 15:36.345
Father!

259
15:36.945 --> 15:38.105
Father!

260
15:43.185 --> 15:45.665
His Majesty collapsed from a fit of rage.

261
15:46.265 --> 15:47.305
He will take the consorts

262
15:47.385 --> 15:48.705
to the Hot Spring Palace to avoid the plague.

263
15:49.785 --> 15:51.825
Qi Zhongkai and I will escort him.

264
15:52.425 --> 15:53.305
We leave tomorrow.

265
15:54.345 --> 15:57.145
The Crown Prince or the Prince of Fu, who goes and who stays?

266
15:57.785 --> 15:59.865
The Crown Prince stays. Prince Fu accompanies.

267
16:00.585 --> 16:02.465
The Empress Dowager resents the Han family case.

268
16:02.545 --> 16:03.985
A lasting rift between them.

269
16:04.825 --> 16:05.945
She harshly rebuked

270
16:06.025 --> 16:08.265
the palace envoy sent to ask her to leave.

271
16:08.905 --> 16:09.865
She insists on staying at Weiyang Palace.

272
16:17.305 --> 16:19.785
His Majesty's life is too precious to put at risk.

273
16:19.865 --> 16:22.785
At a time like this, it's best he seeks refuge elsewhere.

274
16:42.065 --> 16:44.305
What? Reluctant to part with me, Lord Lu?

275
16:47.025 --> 16:48.665
Even if I dragged you along,

276
16:49.225 --> 16:50.065
you'd still refuse.

277
16:51.425 --> 16:53.225
-Am I right? -I'm not going.

278
16:53.745 --> 16:55.345
I have too much to do here.

279
17:03.465 --> 17:04.505
I'll wait for your return.

280
17:06.025 --> 17:07.184
Watch out for hidden attacks.

281
17:09.224 --> 17:10.704
We're about to part ways.

282
17:10.785 --> 17:12.224
No proper goodbyes, my dear?

283
17:12.305 --> 17:13.424
Why must you keep nagging me?

284
17:27.265 --> 17:29.105
Lord Lu, the Duke summons you urgently.

285
17:31.465 --> 17:32.505
You heard it.

286
17:33.305 --> 17:34.385
Grandfather wants a word.

287
17:34.465 --> 17:35.825
Shouldn't you go?

288
17:38.545 --> 17:40.305
I know. You may leave.

289
17:44.825 --> 17:45.665
My Lord.

290
17:46.185 --> 17:48.745
Newlyweds parted so soon. Can't they have a few tender words?

291
17:48.825 --> 17:50.865
You've delivered your message. Give them some privacy.

292
17:51.665 --> 17:54.305
I'll return first and inform His Grace.

293
17:55.705 --> 17:56.905
How tactless.

294
18:26.145 --> 18:28.585
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

295
18:31.705 --> 18:32.985
My Lady.

296
18:33.065 --> 18:34.905
Lady Shou'an sent over some Baoyuan Pills.

297
18:34.985 --> 18:36.145
She says your cousin

298
18:36.225 --> 18:38.385
paid a fortune from a renowned physician in Jiangnan.

299
18:38.985 --> 18:41.185
They're supposed to protect you from the plague.

300
18:41.265 --> 18:42.745
Lady Shou'an was very insistent.

301
18:42.825 --> 18:44.985
She wants you to take one right away, just to be safe.

302
18:50.185 --> 18:52.025
My cousin couldn't have predicted this outbreak.

303
18:52.945 --> 18:55.905
This life-saving medicine was clearly meant for my grandmother.

304
18:56.905 --> 18:59.025
I can't accept it. Send it back.

305
18:59.105 --> 19:01.665
-But, My Lady… -I'm perfectly healthy. I don't need it.

306
19:02.345 --> 19:03.665
Go on.

307
19:04.345 --> 19:05.185
Yes, My Lady.

308
19:05.265 --> 19:08.625
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

309
19:13.225 --> 19:14.265
My Lady!

310
19:15.065 --> 19:17.305
Don't make a fuss. It's just a slight chill.

311
19:18.225 --> 19:20.065
-I'll be fine. -But you…

312
19:20.145 --> 19:21.825
More people are falling ill in the city.

313
19:23.305 --> 19:25.065
Send word to the Duke's Residence.

314
19:25.145 --> 19:27.705
Tell them to shut the gates now. No outsiders are to be admitted.

315
19:28.745 --> 19:30.585
Mother and Fourth Aunt must stop visiting, too.

316
19:30.665 --> 19:31.505
We can't risk bringing the plague in.

317
19:32.105 --> 19:33.345
My Lady…

318
19:33.945 --> 19:36.145
I'll take a hot bath to warm up. Prepare it.

319
19:53.545 --> 19:56.825
Aman. I need you to visit someone for me.

320
20:04.505 --> 20:06.025
Who might you be, miss?

321
20:06.705 --> 20:08.625
Noble Lady Wu'an just passed Zhang Sheng's Bakery.

322
20:08.705 --> 20:10.825
She remembered how much you love their date cakes.

323
20:10.905 --> 20:12.625
She asked me to bring you some.

324
20:15.625 --> 20:17.905
No wonder the magpies were chirping this morning!

325
20:18.505 --> 20:20.545
A distinguished guest has come to visit!

326
20:21.705 --> 20:24.985
How kind of Her Ladyship to remember an old woman like me.

327
20:25.585 --> 20:26.985
Please, come inside.

328
20:30.305 --> 20:32.025
Something suspicious about this old woman.

329
20:32.105 --> 20:33.625
I'll keep watching here. Go report it.

330
20:33.705 --> 20:34.745
Yes.

331
20:41.145 --> 20:43.105
Miss. Here.

332
20:44.305 --> 20:45.985
Thank you for coming all this way.

333
20:46.065 --> 20:47.705
Remember what Her Ladyship said.

334
20:47.785 --> 20:49.945
-Governess Liu, take care of yourself. -I will.

335
20:50.025 --> 20:52.545
The city's in chaos. Keep your doors locked.

336
20:53.145 --> 20:55.745
I'm just an old woman now.

337
20:55.825 --> 20:59.585
Thanks to Her Ladyship, I can live in peace.

338
20:59.665 --> 21:01.105
I know what to do.

339
21:01.705 --> 21:02.945
Tell Her Ladyship not to worry.

340
21:04.705 --> 21:07.625
Thank you. Take care on your way back, miss.

341
21:25.025 --> 21:25.945
Get something to eat.

342
21:33.825 --> 21:35.145
My Lady, Liu is here.

343
21:36.265 --> 21:38.345
My Lady, Feng Sheng has fallen ill, too.

344
21:39.025 --> 21:39.865
Got it.

345
21:42.585 --> 21:43.705
How dare you!

346
21:45.985 --> 21:49.145
When Lord Lu was in the capital, at least someone was looking out for you.

347
21:49.225 --> 21:50.385
But since he left,

348
21:50.985 --> 21:52.625
you've been working here day and night.

349
21:52.705 --> 21:54.185
No one can talk you out of it.

350
21:54.905 --> 21:56.625
My Lady, surely you know the saying.

351
21:56.705 --> 21:58.185
A wise person doesn't court danger.

352
21:58.905 --> 22:00.505
Don't fool me because I had little schooling.

353
22:01.465 --> 22:04.345
Aren't you Confucian scholars all about accepting the will of Heaven?

354
22:04.425 --> 22:06.465
If someone dies doing what they believe is right,

355
22:06.985 --> 22:10.025
isn't that an honorable death?

356
22:10.105 --> 22:13.025
With you at Zhuyu Estate, everyone stands united.

357
22:13.105 --> 22:14.385
Nothing can shake us.

358
22:15.065 --> 22:16.345
But if anything happens to you,

359
22:16.945 --> 22:18.985
everything we've built will fall apart!

360
22:19.065 --> 22:20.865
-My Lady! -My Lady!

361
22:24.105 --> 22:25.145
I'm fine.

362
22:29.465 --> 22:31.225
-My Lady! -My Lady!

363
22:31.305 --> 22:32.905
-My Lady! Fetch the physicians! -My Lady!

364
22:32.985 --> 22:34.105
Get the physicians!

365
22:34.185 --> 22:36.825
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

366
22:50.065 --> 22:52.265
Have you two physicians reached a diagnosis?

367
22:52.345 --> 22:54.185
Her Ladyship's pulse is rapid and superficial.

368
22:54.265 --> 22:55.145
The illness came on suddenly.

369
22:55.745 --> 22:58.465
She has a persistent fever, body aches, and a headache.

370
22:58.545 --> 23:00.265
And she's suddenly feeling chills.

371
23:00.345 --> 23:01.865
I'm afraid…

372
23:01.945 --> 23:03.705
It's definitely the spring plague.

373
23:04.305 --> 23:05.625
My Lady.

374
23:07.065 --> 23:07.985
Thank you both.

375
23:14.945 --> 23:15.865
My Lady.

376
23:17.065 --> 23:19.105
-Liu Ziyang. -My Lady.

377
23:20.025 --> 23:23.185
Starting today, you're in charge of the estate.

378
23:24.225 --> 23:25.065
Yes, My Lady.

379
23:26.025 --> 23:28.065
-Xiao. -My Lady.

380
23:28.745 --> 23:31.705
All the estate guards will be under your command.

381
23:32.625 --> 23:34.385
Make sure you keep order in the estate.

382
23:35.185 --> 23:36.145
Don't let any trouble start.

383
23:38.065 --> 23:40.185
-Rest assured, My Lady. -You may all leave.

384
23:52.305 --> 23:53.585
While I'm ill,

385
23:54.545 --> 23:56.025
don't let my grandmother or the Weis…

386
23:56.105 --> 23:58.385
I understand, My Lady. I won't tell anyone.

387
23:59.185 --> 24:01.545
You've taken your medicine, My Lady. Please rest.

388
24:04.465 --> 24:05.785
I'm just exhausted.

389
24:07.065 --> 24:08.505
I'll be fine after some rest.

390
24:09.665 --> 24:10.505
Don't worry too much.

391
24:16.185 --> 24:18.225
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

392
24:18.305 --> 24:19.225
Aman.

393
24:30.185 --> 24:32.705
Aman. About Her Ladyship's illness…

394
24:32.785 --> 24:34.225
Should we inform Lord Lu?

395
24:39.305 --> 24:40.545
Her Ladyship doesn't want word getting out.

396
24:40.625 --> 24:42.505
Send someone to the palace discreetly.

397
24:49.545 --> 24:50.425
Aman.

398
24:50.945 --> 24:54.465
I've already spread word that Her Ladyship fainted from exhaustion.

399
24:54.545 --> 24:56.025
But the people…

400
24:57.385 --> 24:59.025
They follow her and trust no one else.

401
25:00.265 --> 25:01.545
If she doesn't appear soon,

402
25:02.465 --> 25:03.625
panic will spread.

403
25:05.265 --> 25:06.625
Her Ladyship's health comes first.

404
25:07.225 --> 25:10.105
As for everything else, we can't worry about that now.

405
25:20.385 --> 25:21.785
I heard Lord Han

406
25:21.865 --> 25:23.665
once asked you to identify Wei Rao in person.

407
25:23.745 --> 25:26.025
Yet you deliberately gave him vague answers.

408
25:26.105 --> 25:27.665
You've been playing both sides.

409
25:28.225 --> 25:31.785
Back then, I really didn't recognize her.

410
25:32.305 --> 25:35.185
I wasn't trying to deceive anyone! I…

411
25:38.625 --> 25:41.905
I wouldn't dare! Never again!

412
25:41.985 --> 25:44.225
You'd be wise to cooperate.

413
25:44.305 --> 25:46.185
Just say exactly what I tell you,

414
25:47.585 --> 25:50.105
and these gold bars are yours.

415
25:51.905 --> 25:53.305
Otherwise,

416
25:53.385 --> 25:55.465
you'll get to experience

417
25:55.985 --> 25:57.865
all eighteen instruments of torture!

418
26:12.185 --> 26:14.785
Whatever Your Ladyship says,

419
26:14.865 --> 26:18.505
I'll do exactly as I'm told.

420
26:20.185 --> 26:21.065
Your Highness.

421
26:21.705 --> 26:23.905
That old woman has confessed everything.

422
26:26.065 --> 26:29.225
-Really? -Everyone has their price.

423
26:29.825 --> 26:33.025
What would a petty beggar know about loyalty or honor?

424
26:33.105 --> 26:35.825
We threatened her with a beating and offered her a fortune.

425
26:36.745 --> 26:37.945
Naturally, she spilt it all.

426
26:38.825 --> 26:40.265
Nothing will go wrong this time.

427
26:42.145 --> 26:43.825
People of such low birth…

428
26:44.825 --> 26:46.545
they of course have no backbone.

429
26:47.185 --> 26:49.745
Whatever I tell her to say, she'll repeat it word for word.

430
26:50.345 --> 26:53.185
Even if she's plotting something and hasn't truly joined our side,

431
26:54.425 --> 26:56.785
once the Empress Dowager pronounces guilt before all,

432
26:56.865 --> 26:59.465
there'll be no turning back.

433
27:00.065 --> 27:01.185
Good.

434
27:02.585 --> 27:05.145
I'll go see Grandmother at the palace right away.

435
27:15.425 --> 27:16.265
What did you say?

436
27:16.865 --> 27:18.465
I've secured a witness

437
27:18.545 --> 27:20.065
who can prove Wei Rao is nothing but

438
27:20.145 --> 27:21.745
an impostor and a commoner's daughter.

439
27:24.785 --> 27:27.225
His Majesty granted her the title of Noble Lady.

440
27:27.985 --> 27:29.665
If you're accusing her for that,

441
27:29.745 --> 27:31.625
you'd better have solid proof.

442
27:33.465 --> 27:34.745
Your Majesty,

443
27:35.265 --> 27:38.465
It's exactly because His Majesty bestowed this title himself.

444
27:39.065 --> 27:40.465
Lady Shou'an and her daughter

445
27:40.545 --> 27:43.585
knew she was an impostor and went to great lengths to cover it up.

446
27:44.425 --> 27:46.025
They've clearly deceived the Emperor.

447
27:46.625 --> 27:47.865
Such a crime is unforgivable.

448
27:50.385 --> 27:52.145
In that case…

449
27:54.745 --> 27:59.185
We ought to deal with that old woman as well.

450
27:59.785 --> 28:01.425
Anyone who deceives the Emperor

451
28:02.305 --> 28:04.225
deserves to die.

452
28:05.105 --> 28:06.745
By executing her,

453
28:07.425 --> 28:08.945
Your Majesty is rooting out treachery

454
28:09.025 --> 28:09.865
for the state.

455
28:11.185 --> 28:13.945
By the time His Majesty returns, it'll be too late.

456
28:14.545 --> 28:18.025
He's your own son. What could he possibly do?

457
28:18.745 --> 28:19.665
Grandmother,

458
28:20.185 --> 28:21.545
the dead cannot be brought back.

459
28:21.625 --> 28:22.985
We mustn't let a dead woman

460
28:23.065 --> 28:24.705
undermine your authority.

461
28:25.305 --> 28:27.065
To protect the royal family's reputation,

462
28:27.145 --> 28:29.265
Father will have no choice but to see her as a traitor.

463
28:30.065 --> 28:31.785
We may never get another chance.

464
28:31.865 --> 28:33.865
Please make your decision, Grandmother.

465
28:39.625 --> 28:40.585
Make the arrangements.

466
28:44.425 --> 28:46.505
-Yes, Your Majesty. -Yes, Your Majesty.

467
29:00.145 --> 29:01.945
-Continue your patrol. -Yes, sir.

468
29:14.225 --> 29:15.065
What are you looking at?

469
29:16.465 --> 29:17.945
Since I left, I wonder

470
29:18.785 --> 29:20.505
is Wei Rao eating

471
29:21.065 --> 29:21.945
and sleeping well?

472
29:27.825 --> 29:29.745
You really think highly of yourself.

473
29:30.265 --> 29:31.505
Do you think without you,

474
29:31.585 --> 29:33.625
Noble Lady Wu'an has no one to look after her?

475
29:36.305 --> 29:37.745
She's as stubborn as a mule,

476
29:38.705 --> 29:39.865
with a will of her own.

477
29:41.745 --> 29:44.305
She'd never listen to anyone else.

478
29:52.265 --> 29:53.305
What are you doing?

479
29:53.385 --> 29:56.625
That's what you get for making me jealous. It's enough to make my teeth ache.

480
29:57.665 --> 29:58.865
Since you can't sleep anyway,

481
29:58.945 --> 30:01.065
why don't you spar with me?

482
30:03.785 --> 30:04.705
So be it.

483
30:05.225 --> 30:07.385
Let's find somewhere I can put you through your paces.

484
30:08.225 --> 30:09.065
Follow me.

485
30:17.865 --> 30:18.825
My Lady.

486
30:25.705 --> 30:26.545
Who's on watch tonight?

487
30:26.625 --> 30:30.025
Xiao doesn't trust anyone else to do it. He insists on guarding you himself.

488
30:31.265 --> 30:33.185
-Let him in. -Yes, My Lady.

489
30:47.385 --> 30:48.385
Xiao.

490
30:48.985 --> 30:50.145
I sent Hongxian

491
30:50.665 --> 30:52.385
to the Fourth Prince's Residence.

492
30:53.545 --> 30:54.465
Do you hate me for it?

493
30:55.265 --> 30:56.385
If she'd ended up with me,

494
30:57.105 --> 30:58.425
she would regretted it forever.

495
30:59.345 --> 31:01.785
It's this unjust world that's to blame. Not her.

496
31:03.185 --> 31:04.025
Certainly not you.

497
31:05.665 --> 31:08.825
You've been serving me all this time. It's been unfair to you.

498
31:09.945 --> 31:11.265
I've spoken with Lord Lu.

499
31:12.025 --> 31:13.985
You should be in the army for better merit.

500
31:14.505 --> 31:16.345
One day, you'll accomplish great things.

501
31:16.945 --> 31:19.185
When I see those corrupt, incompetent officials,

502
31:19.265 --> 31:21.705
I want to tear them apart.

503
31:22.425 --> 31:23.825
Even in the army,

504
31:23.905 --> 31:25.185
only noble sons can rise through the ranks.

505
31:26.425 --> 31:27.385
I'm not going anywhere.

506
31:28.345 --> 31:29.745
I'll stay by your side for the rest of my life.

507
31:37.065 --> 31:37.945
All right.

508
31:42.225 --> 31:43.505
From this day forward,

509
31:44.665 --> 31:47.145
you'll be the sharpest blade in my hand.

510
31:48.385 --> 31:49.305
Right now,

511
31:49.985 --> 31:51.545
there's something I need you to do.

512
31:52.425 --> 31:53.825
I'm at your command, My Lady.

513
31:58.625 --> 32:01.185
ZHUYU ESTATE

514
32:09.385 --> 32:10.745
Who dares trespass on Zhuyu Estate?

515
32:11.345 --> 32:12.865
By order of the Empress Dowager,

516
32:12.945 --> 32:14.905
we're here to arrest Wei Rao for deceiving the Emperor.

517
32:14.985 --> 32:17.345
Anyone who interferes will face the same charges!

518
32:26.185 --> 32:27.625
My Lady, something terrible!

519
32:27.705 --> 32:29.065
The Imperial Guards have forced their way into the estate!

520
32:29.145 --> 32:31.145
They… they're…

521
32:33.905 --> 32:35.185
What do you think you're doing?

522
32:37.585 --> 32:38.625
My Lady!

523
32:41.065 --> 32:42.265
You vicious woman.

524
32:42.865 --> 32:44.305
I've finally got you.

525
32:48.225 --> 32:50.065
What? Nothing to say?

526
32:52.665 --> 32:54.425
This is but private vengeance.

527
32:54.505 --> 32:56.345
You're the first to die.

528
32:57.505 --> 32:59.825
I'll send Lu Zhuo to join you in the underworld soon.

529
33:00.705 --> 33:01.745
Move.

530
33:05.625 --> 33:06.785
My Lady!

531
33:07.825 --> 33:08.985
Move!

532
33:10.105 --> 33:11.625
-My Lady! -My Lady!

533
33:11.705 --> 33:12.545
ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

534
33:15.385 --> 33:16.985
-After her! Hurry! -This way!

535
33:17.505 --> 33:18.425
-Stop! -Keep up!

536
33:19.585 --> 33:20.945
Stop!

537
33:21.025 --> 33:22.305
Cut her off!

538
33:33.145 --> 33:34.345
Why aren't we there yet?

539
33:34.425 --> 33:36.865
Don't worry, Grandmother. We're almost there.

540
33:37.705 --> 33:39.265
But there are patients at the estate.

541
33:39.345 --> 33:40.425
You promised me

542
33:40.505 --> 33:42.705
you'd only see Wei Rao from outside the gates.

543
33:42.785 --> 33:44.585
Once you know she's safe, we'll head back.

544
33:45.225 --> 33:46.105
Please keep your word.

545
33:46.705 --> 33:48.425
I know.

546
33:48.505 --> 33:50.185
I'm not as selfless as she is,

547
33:50.265 --> 33:51.905
risking my life to save others.

548
33:51.985 --> 33:54.905
I just want to see Wei Rao get the medicine.

549
33:54.985 --> 33:56.265
Then I'll leave right away.

550
34:08.264 --> 34:10.225
Lady Shou'an! Something awful has happened!

551
34:15.225 --> 34:17.905
-Why have they arrested her? -Exactly!

552
34:17.985 --> 34:20.025
Why have they tied her up?

553
34:29.304 --> 34:31.865
Sound the gong! Gather the townspeople!

554
34:32.665 --> 34:35.065
Let them see for themselves how this fraud

555
34:35.145 --> 34:37.905
deceived everyone and passed herself off as a noblewoman!

556
34:37.985 --> 34:39.465
-That can't be true! -How is that possible?

557
34:41.145 --> 34:43.344
-How can they do such a thing? -They've arrested Her Ladyship!

558
34:43.425 --> 34:45.225
Why would they arrest her?

559
34:45.304 --> 34:46.505
What did she do wrong?

560
34:46.585 --> 34:48.744
-She's a good person! -Why are they doing this to her?

561
34:48.824 --> 34:50.385
-You can't do this! -Exactly!

562
34:50.465 --> 34:51.665
-Let her go! -Why arrest her?

563
34:51.744 --> 34:53.065
That's right! What has she done?

564
34:53.145 --> 34:55.425
-She's helped so many people! -Let her go!

565
34:55.505 --> 34:56.824
You'll pay for this soon enough.

566
35:00.625 --> 35:02.145
What's wrong with that man?

567
35:02.225 --> 35:04.705
-Why did he shove her down? -How can he do it?

568
35:04.785 --> 35:07.305
The Empress Dowager has arrived!

569
35:09.105 --> 35:11.545
Look! Look at those carriages!

570
35:13.785 --> 35:15.145
What's with this huge procession?

571
35:15.225 --> 35:17.425
-That's our land! -Those are our crops!

572
35:17.505 --> 35:20.585
They're crushing all our food!

573
35:20.665 --> 35:21.865
Exactly!

574
35:22.705 --> 35:24.465
How could they do this?

575
35:24.545 --> 35:26.705
We worked so hard to grow those crops!

576
35:26.785 --> 35:29.185
Why are they destroying our food?

577
35:29.265 --> 35:30.945
How could you do this to us?

578
35:31.025 --> 35:32.345
This is outrageous!

579
35:32.425 --> 35:33.625
They've trampled everything!

580
35:34.505 --> 35:36.785
-The Empress Dowager's here! -They're destroying our crops!

581
35:38.345 --> 35:39.705
How could they do this?

582
35:39.785 --> 35:41.385
Greetings, Your Majesty.

583
35:50.225 --> 35:51.065
Kneel!

584
35:57.825 --> 35:58.745
Your Majesty.

585
35:58.825 --> 36:00.745
These mountain refugees don't know proper manners.

586
36:00.825 --> 36:01.825
Please don't mind them.

587
36:02.705 --> 36:03.945
-That's right! -Make them kneel!

588
36:04.025 --> 36:05.705
They trampled our crops!

589
36:05.785 --> 36:07.025
All of you, kneel!

590
36:07.105 --> 36:08.265
-You crushed our crops! -We won't kneel!

591
36:08.345 --> 36:10.025
-Kneel! -Get down!

592
36:10.105 --> 36:10.945
We won't!

593
36:11.025 --> 36:12.705
-Kneel! -We refuse!

594
36:12.785 --> 36:14.345
-We won't! -You destroyed our crops!

595
36:14.425 --> 36:17.385
These ignorant peasants are out of control.

596
36:17.465 --> 36:20.385
Clearly, Wu'an has failed to teach them.

597
36:20.465 --> 36:23.265
If this continues, rebellion will follow.

598
36:23.865 --> 36:25.025
Bring in the witness.

599
36:30.265 --> 36:32.345
Tell us everything you know.

600
36:32.425 --> 36:35.305
Leave nothing out, and your crimes will be forgiven.

601
36:36.425 --> 36:38.705
I was close to Governess Chang,

602
36:38.785 --> 36:42.545
a trusted servant of the First Madam at the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

603
36:43.185 --> 36:45.305
One day, after she'd been drinking,

604
36:45.385 --> 36:48.545
she told me how the Fourth Lady Wei had gone missing as a child.

605
36:48.625 --> 36:51.465
Later, I happened to see her true face.

606
36:51.545 --> 36:53.545
She looked just like my neighbor, A-Chou.

607
36:53.625 --> 36:56.305
So I plotted with A-Chou's mother, Madam Qiao,

608
36:56.385 --> 36:59.305
to pass her off as Lady Wei for money.

609
37:06.025 --> 37:09.185
Lord Lu! Word from Zhuyu Estate! Her Ladyship is gravely ill!

610
37:09.825 --> 37:11.505
What proof do you have?

611
37:11.585 --> 37:14.465
I have proof! Look!

612
37:14.545 --> 37:17.225
See all these old scars on her arm?

613
37:18.105 --> 37:21.345
This one came from a hot pot when she was five.

614
37:21.425 --> 37:25.945
And this one was from when her master beat her with red-hot tongs.

615
37:26.745 --> 37:28.225
Deny it all you want.

616
37:28.305 --> 37:30.625
Burned skin always leaves a scar.

617
37:30.705 --> 37:33.705
You used to collect night soil!

618
37:33.785 --> 37:35.385
She's nothing but a fraud!

619
37:35.465 --> 37:37.185
-You're lying! -That's a lie!

620
37:37.265 --> 37:38.825
How could Her Ladyship be a fraud?

621
37:38.905 --> 37:40.305
You're lying!

622
37:40.385 --> 37:42.985
-Exactly! -She's framing her!

623
37:43.065 --> 37:44.865
-Nonsense! -That's right! All lies!

624
37:44.945 --> 37:45.945
-She's making it up! -Liar!

625
37:46.025 --> 37:46.905
Get out of the way!

626
37:48.545 --> 37:49.385
Help her up.

627
37:50.265 --> 37:51.385
Put this around her.

628
37:56.225 --> 37:57.305
Grandmother.

629
38:03.425 --> 38:04.505
Your Majesty.

630
38:05.025 --> 38:07.265
My poor Rao once lived among the common folk.

631
38:07.345 --> 38:10.985
But as for which Wei Rao is real, that matter was settled long ago.

632
38:11.665 --> 38:13.225
She is indeed Wei Rao,

633
38:13.305 --> 38:15.545
Lady Li's own daughter.

634
38:15.625 --> 38:17.905
If Your Majesty still has doubts,

635
38:17.985 --> 38:20.105
why not ask her birth mother

636
38:20.185 --> 38:22.705
instead of some old woman we know nothing about?

637
38:23.745 --> 38:24.905
Lady Shou'an,

638
38:25.865 --> 38:27.505
Lady Li may be Wei Rao's birth mother,

639
38:27.585 --> 38:31.265
but palace rules kept them apart for years.

640
38:31.345 --> 38:32.385
How could she tell?

641
38:33.705 --> 38:34.945
Poor Rao lost her parents

642
38:35.545 --> 38:37.425
My parents raised her as their own.

643
38:37.505 --> 38:40.025
We grew up together from infancy.

644
38:41.225 --> 38:42.425
I can vouch for her.

645
38:42.945 --> 38:44.945
So can everyone at the Earl's Residence.

646
38:45.625 --> 38:49.505
Old Madam Wei is gravely ill, and doesn't have long to live.

647
38:50.105 --> 38:52.105
That's why you dare spout such nonsense.

648
38:52.865 --> 38:54.345
You keep claiming you know her.

649
38:54.945 --> 38:56.505
How could someone your age know?

650
38:56.585 --> 38:58.225
Do you think your word carries more weight

651
38:58.305 --> 39:00.785
than Wei Rao's own mother and grandmother?

652
39:01.785 --> 39:05.345
And don't forget how you became Crown Princess.

653
39:05.945 --> 39:07.385
Your second uncle

654
39:07.465 --> 39:11.105
gave his life fighting on the battlefield to earn you that title.

655
39:11.705 --> 39:13.065
Yet here you stand,

656
39:13.145 --> 39:15.945
slandering his only child!

657
39:16.025 --> 39:20.025
Have you no conscience? Have you no shame?

658
39:20.745 --> 39:21.665
How dare you!

659
39:22.665 --> 39:24.225
The royal family respects you

660
39:24.305 --> 39:26.425
because you once nursed my father.

661
39:26.505 --> 39:28.145
How dare you speak so wildly,

662
39:28.225 --> 39:29.065
playing the elder like that!

663
39:29.665 --> 39:31.705
The Earl of Cheng'an told Her Majesty everything.

664
39:31.785 --> 39:36.385
That woman is a fraud who swindled people out of money!

665
39:37.105 --> 39:40.625
Guards! Take the criminal A-Chou to the imperial prison.

666
39:41.225 --> 39:43.185
Kill anyone who resists!

667
39:43.825 --> 39:45.345
-Let her go! -Release Her Ladyship!

668
39:45.425 --> 39:47.705
-Let her go! -Stand back! Hear me?

669
39:47.785 --> 39:48.945
Stand back!

670
39:49.025 --> 39:50.145
-Let her go! -Release Her Ladyship!

671
39:50.225 --> 39:52.385
Your Majesty, Wei Rao…

672
39:52.465 --> 39:56.105
was personally granted the title of Noble Lady Wu'an!

673
39:56.785 --> 39:58.825
Any charges must be heard by the court.

674
39:58.905 --> 40:02.545
His Majesty is away avoiding the plague, and no one is presiding over the court.

675
40:02.625 --> 40:05.505
How can you simply imprison someone who holds a noble title?

676
40:06.505 --> 40:07.665
Grandmother.

677
40:09.665 --> 40:11.105
Don't you understand yet?

678
40:11.745 --> 40:13.025
The witness doesn't matter.

679
40:14.745 --> 40:16.425
Neither does her testimony.

680
40:18.665 --> 40:20.265
The Empress Dowager

681
40:20.345 --> 40:23.105
is taking advantage of the Emperor and Lady Li's absence

682
40:23.865 --> 40:25.105
to get rid of me.

683
40:25.185 --> 40:27.625
She wants to wipe me out

684
40:28.345 --> 40:29.665
so I'll never pose a threat again.

685
40:30.585 --> 40:33.265
Once I leave Zhuyu Estate today,

686
40:34.425 --> 40:36.145
I'll likely die in some nameless valley.

687
40:36.745 --> 40:38.225
By the time His Majesty returns,

688
40:39.105 --> 40:42.305
it'll be too late. There'll be no one left to tell the truth!

689
40:42.385 --> 40:45.265
Silence! A criminal has no right to speak here!

690
40:48.465 --> 40:49.665
Why did you hit him?

691
40:49.745 --> 40:50.625
-What are you doing? -Stop it!

692
40:50.705 --> 40:53.585
If Lu Zhuo were here, he could fight me.

693
40:53.665 --> 40:55.345
But you think you can take me on?

694
40:55.425 --> 40:58.465
Han Liao! My cousin has nothing to do with this.

695
40:59.145 --> 41:00.305
Don't hurt an innocent man!

696
41:00.385 --> 41:02.385
Still defending that pretty boy?

697
41:03.105 --> 41:04.985
I'll cut off his head

698
41:05.065 --> 41:06.985
and hang it over the gates of Zhuyu Estate!

699
41:12.905 --> 41:14.265
Your Majesty!

700
41:17.065 --> 41:18.265
Grandmother, don't beg her!

701
41:19.185 --> 41:21.025
-Grandmother! -Your Majesty!

702
41:21.105 --> 41:24.505
I was foolish and stubborn before. I offended you time and again.

703
41:24.585 --> 41:27.305
I alone am to blame for everything.

704
41:27.825 --> 41:31.225
Beat me or punish me however you wish.

705
41:31.305 --> 41:32.425
Get up.

706
41:32.945 --> 41:36.185
Please, get up! Get up!

707
41:41.865 --> 41:43.025
My dear Rao

708
41:43.905 --> 41:45.825
has suffered so much in her life.

709
41:46.865 --> 41:49.225
She knows how hard life is for ordinary people.

710
41:49.745 --> 41:52.345
That's why she worked so hard to build this estate,

711
41:52.425 --> 41:55.185
to shelter the poor and helpless.

712
41:55.265 --> 41:57.025
What has she done wrong?

713
41:57.105 --> 41:59.065
You wanted to see her hands, didn't you?

714
41:59.145 --> 42:01.305
Then take a closer look!

715
42:01.385 --> 42:03.905
Rao works alongside the common folk.

716
42:03.985 --> 42:06.265
Her hands are covered in scars and calluses.

717
42:07.785 --> 42:09.745
Even the clothes she wears

718
42:09.825 --> 42:12.625
are never made of soft silk.

719
42:13.505 --> 42:15.945
She wears cotton woven here at the estate.

720
42:16.825 --> 42:19.425
All the gold, silver, and jewels His Majesty gave her

721
42:19.505 --> 42:22.225
were traded for coarse grain to feed the hungry.

722
42:22.305 --> 42:23.745
The granaries

723
42:24.705 --> 42:26.065
are completely empty now.

724
42:26.825 --> 42:29.505
She's given everything to save lives.

725
42:29.585 --> 42:30.905
So here,

726
42:31.585 --> 42:33.585
I beg Your Majesty to show mercy.

727
42:34.705 --> 42:37.465
Take me away in chains instead. Please, spare her.

728
42:37.985 --> 42:41.225
No. Don't, Grandmother.

729
42:41.985 --> 42:44.705
Lady Shou'an, you and your daughter

730
42:45.225 --> 42:46.785
are both blind to the truth.

731
42:47.465 --> 42:49.425
You actually believe this impostor,

732
42:50.425 --> 42:52.105
and killed the real Wei's daughter.

733
42:53.185 --> 42:54.825
And you still refuse to admit your mistake.

734
42:54.905 --> 42:58.505
Now, in your pursuit of power,

735
42:59.105 --> 43:00.625
you've only made things worse.

736
43:00.705 --> 43:01.985
You've sealed your own fate.

737
43:02.905 --> 43:05.265
You brought this woman, who falsely claimed noble birth,

738
43:05.345 --> 43:06.985
into the palace

739
43:07.065 --> 43:09.345
and deceived the Emperor.

740
43:09.865 --> 43:13.305
Defending her only proves you're guilty, too.

741
43:14.145 --> 43:18.985
Guards. Take them both to prison and interrogate them under torture.

742
43:19.065 --> 43:20.585
Grandmother! Wei Rao!

743
43:22.985 --> 43:23.825
Guards!

744
43:23.905 --> 43:25.265
-Release Her Ladyship! -Let her go!

745
43:25.345 --> 43:26.185
Let go of me!

746
43:26.265 --> 43:27.105
-Release Her Ladyship! -Let her go!

747
43:27.185 --> 43:28.545
-Grandmother! -Let go!

748
43:28.625 --> 43:29.545
-Grandmother! -Let go of me!

749
43:29.625 --> 43:32.025
-Grandmother! -I won't let go! Rao!

750
43:32.105 --> 43:33.665
I won't let go!

751
43:33.745 --> 43:35.465
-Han Liao! -Rao!

752
43:35.545 --> 43:37.385
His Majesty holds Lady Shou'an in the highest regard!

753
43:37.465 --> 43:38.625
Rao!

754
43:38.705 --> 43:41.465
Aren't you afraid he'll make you pay?

755
43:42.505 --> 43:45.305
If you must arrest someone, arrest me instead.

756
43:47.945 --> 43:48.785
Your Majesty,

757
43:50.065 --> 43:52.185
this fraud has committed a terrible crime.

758
43:52.785 --> 43:55.065
Throwing her in prison would be letting her off too easily.

759
43:55.145 --> 43:57.025
What do you suggest?

760
43:57.105 --> 44:01.225
Anyone caught deceiving the realm should be paraded in a wooden collar

761
44:01.945 --> 44:03.265
to the sound of the gong.

762
44:03.345 --> 44:06.065
Let her serve as a warning to everyone.

763
44:08.225 --> 44:09.505
See to it.

764
44:13.625 --> 44:16.345
-Rao! Rao! -Wei Rao!

765
44:16.425 --> 44:21.585
-Release Her Ladyship! -Let her go!

766
44:22.265 --> 44:25.265
Anyone who helps her will be punished!

767
44:25.345 --> 44:28.945
-Release Her Ladyship! -Let her go!

768
44:29.545 --> 44:30.785
You brought this on yourself.

769
44:31.545 --> 44:34.705
Heavens above, open your eyes!

770
44:34.785 --> 44:38.025
Why do those who trample the poor live in luxury,

771
44:38.105 --> 44:42.425
while those who work so hard go hungry?

772
44:43.105 --> 44:46.865
He's taking away the one who saved us!

773
44:46.945 --> 44:50.425
You can't take Her Ladyship away!

774
44:51.145 --> 44:56.705
Set Her Ladyship free!

775
47:06.145 --> 47:08.705
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
